SiteLedger (Builder Costing) - Account & Data Deletion

Operated by BBS. Last updated: August 2, 2026

You can request deletion of your SiteLedger account and all associated data at any time.

How to request deletion
Email arifmoneeb02@gmail.com from the email address associated with your SiteLedger account, with the subject line "Delete my account". Please include your account email so we can locate your account.

What gets deleted
When we process your request, we permanently delete:
- your account and profile (name, email, phone number)
- your company / organization
- all projects, expenses, budgets, and payments you recorded
- all receipt photos you uploaded

What is retained
Nothing. We do not retain your personal data after deletion. Payment and subscription records are held by Google Play under Google's own policies and are not stored by us.

Timeframe
We will action your request and delete your account and data within 30 days.

